      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MYSTERY FLIGHT (1) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Maiden win two back at this track. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Well placed here and can atone this time. SEBON KNIGHT (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.92) at this track behind Aurora Borealis in a TG1-4W. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Hard to beat again. CREEPER (2) is another with top-three prospects.",
